V. EXPERIMENTS
In order to test whether our proposed model is effective for detecting spear phishing emails, we have designed the following experiments. We ﬁrst evaluate the impact of the reputation and forwarding features on the model, and then we compare the gains of the SMOTE algorithm and the KMSMOTE algorithm, ﬁnally we use all the features and data enhancement algorithm compared with the state of the art method.

